# No Cursor co-author

Until Abid says otherwise, never add Cursor (or Cursor Agent) as a git co-author.

- Do not put `Co-authored-by: Cursor` (or any Cursor/cursoragent email) in commit messages
- Do not append that trailer when committing or pushing to `main`
- Commits should be authored only as Abid / the existing git user
